{"1":{"w":[{"c":"الْحَمْدُ","d":"al-ḥamdu","e":"All praises"},{"c":"لِلَّهِ","d":"lillahi","e":"(be) to Allah"},{"c":"فَاطِرِ","d":"fāṭiri","e":"Creator"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"(of) the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"جَاعِلِ","d":"jāʿili","e":"(Who) makes"},{"c":"الْمَلَائِكَةِ","d":"l-malāikati","e":"the Angels"},{"c":"رُسُلًا","d":"rusulan","e":"messengers"},{"c":"أُولِي","d":"ulī","e":"having wings"},{"c":"أَجْنِحَةٍ","d":"ajniḥatin","e":"having wings"},{"c":"مَثْنَى","d":"mathnā","e":"two"},{"c":"وَثُلَاثَ","d":"wathulātha","e":"or three"},{"c":"وَرُبَاعَ","d":"warubāʿa","e":"or four"},{"c":"يَزِيدُ","d":"yazīdu","e":"He increases"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْخَلْقِ","d":"l-khalqi","e":"the creation"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"يَشَاءُ","d":"yashāu","e":"He wills"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"(is) on"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"every"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"قَدِيرٌ","d":"qadīrun","e":"All-Powerful"}],"a":{"g":"[All] praise is [due] to Allah, Creator of the heavens and the earth, [who] made the angels messengers having wings, two or three or four. He increases in creation what He wills. Indeed, Allah is over all things competent."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"What"},{"c":"يَفْتَحِ","d":"yaftaḥi","e":"Allah grants"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah grants"},{"c":"لِلنَّاسِ","d":"lilnnāsi","e":"to mankind"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"رَحْمَةٍ","d":"raḥmatin","e":"Mercy"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"then none"},{"c":"مُمْسِكَ","d":"mum'sika","e":"(can) withhold"},{"c":"لَهَا","d":"lahā","e":"it"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"يُمْسِكْ","d":"yum'sik","e":"He withholds"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"then none"},{"c":"مُرْسِلَ","d":"mur'sila","e":"(can) release"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"it"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"thereafter"},{"c":"بَعْدِهِ","d":"baʿdihi","e":"thereafter"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"And He"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزُ","d":"l-ʿazīzu","e":"(is) the All-Mighty"},{"c":"الْحَكِيمُ","d":"l-ḥakīmu","e":"the All-Wise"}],"a":{"g":"Whatever Allah grants to people of mercy - none can withhold it; and whatever He withholds - none can release it thereafter. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"يَاأَيُّهَا","d":"yāayyuhā","e":"O"},{"c":"النَّاسُ","d":"l-nāsu","e":"mankind"},{"c":"اذْكُرُوا","d":"udh'kurū","e":"Remember"},{"c":"نِعْمَتَ","d":"niʿ'mata","e":"(the) Favor"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"عَلَيْكُمْ","d":"ʿalaykum","e":"upon you"},{"c":"هَلْ","d":"hal","e":"Is"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(there) any"},{"c":"خَالِقٍ","d":"khāliqin","e":"creator"},{"c":"غَيْرُ","d":"ghayru","e":"other (than) Allah"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"other (than) Allah"},{"c":"يَرْزُقُكُمْ","d":"yarzuqukum","e":"who provides for you"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the sky"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(There is) no"},{"c":"إِلَهَ","d":"ilāha","e":"god"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"فَأَنَّى","d":"fa-annā","e":"Then, how"},{"c":"تُؤْفَكُونَ","d":"tu'fakūna","e":"(are) you deluded"}],"a":{"g":"O mankind, remember the favor of Allah upon you. Is there any creator other than Allah who provides for you from the heaven and earth? There is no deity except Him, so how are you deluded?"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"And if"},{"c":"يُكَذِّبُوكَ","d":"yukadhibūka","e":"they deny you"},{"c":"فَقَدْ","d":"faqad","e":"then certainly"},{"c":"كُذِّبَتْ","d":"kudhibat","e":"were denied"},{"c":"رُسُلٌ","d":"rusulun","e":"Messengers"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before you"},{"c":"قَبْلِكَ","d":"qablika","e":"before you"},{"c":"وَإِلَى","d":"wa-ilā","e":"And to"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"تُرْجَعُ","d":"tur'jaʿu","e":"return"},{"c":"الْأُمُورُ","d":"l-umūru","e":"the matters"}],"a":{"g":"And if they deny you, [O Muhammad] - already were messengers denied before you. And to Allah are returned [all] matters."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"يَاأَيُّهَا","d":"yāayyuhā","e":"O"},{"c":"النَّاسُ","d":"l-nāsu","e":"mankind!"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"وَعْدَ","d":"waʿda","e":"(the) promise"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"حَقٌّ","d":"ḥaqqun","e":"(is) true"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"So (let) not"},{"c":"تَغُرَّنَّكُمُ","d":"taghurrannakumu","e":"deceive you"},{"c":"الْحَيَوةُ","d":"l-ḥayatu","e":"the life"},{"c":"الدُّنْيَا","d":"l-dun'yā","e":"(of) the world"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and (let) not"},{"c":"يَغُرَّنَّكُمْ","d":"yaghurrannakum","e":"deceive you"},{"c":"بِاللَّهِ","d":"bil-lahi","e":"about Allah"},{"c":"الْغَرُورُ","d":"l-gharūru","e":"the Deceiver"}],"a":{"g":"O mankind, indeed the promise of Allah is truth, so let not the worldly life delude you and be not deceived about Allah by the Deceiver."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الشَّيْطَانَ","d":"l-shayṭāna","e":"the Shaitaan"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"(is) to you"},{"c":"عَدُوٌّ","d":"ʿaduwwun","e":"an enemy"},{"c":"فَاتَّخِذُوهُ","d":"fa-ittakhidhūhu","e":"so take him"},{"c":"عَدُوًّا","d":"ʿaduwwan","e":"(as) an enemy"},{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"يَدْعُوا","d":"yadʿū","e":"he invites"},{"c":"حِزْبَهُ","d":"ḥiz'bahu","e":"his party"},{"c":"لِيَكُونُوا","d":"liyakūnū","e":"that they may be"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"among"},{"c":"أَصْحَابِ","d":"aṣḥābi","e":"(the) companions"},{"c":"السَّعِيرِ","d":"l-saʿīri","e":"(of) the Blaze"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, Satan is an enemy to you; so take him as an enemy. He only invites his party to be among the companions of the Blaze."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"Those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"عَذَابٌ","d":"ʿadhābun","e":"(will be) a punishment"},{"c":"شَدِيدٌ","d":"shadīdun","e":"severe"},{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"and those"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"who believe"},{"c":"وَعَمِلُوا","d":"waʿamilū","e":"and do"},{"c":"الصَّالِحَاتِ","d":"l-ṣāliḥāti","e":"righteous deeds"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"مَغْفِرَةٌ","d":"maghfiratun","e":"(will be) forgiveness"},{"c":"وَأَجْرٌ","d":"wa-ajrun","e":"and a reward"},{"c":"كَبِيرٌ","d":"kabīrun","e":"great"}],"a":{"g":"Those who disbelieve will have a severe punishment, and those who believe and do righteous deeds will have forgiveness and great reward."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"أَفَمَنْ","d":"afaman","e":"Then is (he) who"},{"c":"زُيِّنَ","d":"zuyyina","e":"is made fair-seeming"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"to him"},{"c":"سُوءُ","d":"sūu","e":"(the) evil"},{"c":"عَمَلِهِ","d":"ʿamalihi","e":"(of) his deed"},{"c":"فَرَءَاهُ","d":"faraāhu","e":"so that he sees it"},{"c":"حَسَنًا","d":"ḥasanan","e":"(as) good"},{"c":"فَإِنَّ","d":"fa-inna","e":"For indeed"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"يُضِلُّ","d":"yuḍillu","e":"lets go astray"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"whom"},{"c":"يَشَاءُ","d":"yashāu","e":"He wills"},{"c":"وَيَهْدِي","d":"wayahdī","e":"and guides"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"whom"},{"c":"يَشَاءُ","d":"yashāu","e":"He wills"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"So (let) not"},{"c":"تَذْهَبْ","d":"tadhhab","e":"go out"},{"c":"نَفْسُكَ","d":"nafsuka","e":"your soul"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"for them"},{"c":"حَسَرَاتٍ","d":"ḥasarātin","e":"(in) regrets"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"عَلِيمٌ","d":"ʿalīmun","e":"(is) All-Knower"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"of what"},{"c":"يَصْنَعُونَ","d":"yaṣnaʿūna","e":"they do"}],"a":{"g":"Then is one to whom the evil of his deed has been made attractive so he considers it good [like one rightly guided]? For indeed, Allah sends astray whom He wills and guides whom He wills. So do not let yourself perish over them in regret. Indeed, Allah is Knowing of what they do."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) the One Who"},{"c":"أَرْسَلَ","d":"arsala","e":"sends"},{"c":"الرِّيَاحَ","d":"l-riyāḥa","e":"the winds"},{"c":"فَتُثِيرُ","d":"fatuthīru","e":"so that they raise"},{"c":"سَحَابًا","d":"saḥāban","e":"(the) clouds"},{"c":"فَسُقْنَاهُ","d":"fasuq'nāhu","e":"and We drive them"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"بَلَدٍ","d":"baladin","e":"a land"},{"c":"مَيِّتٍ","d":"mayyitin","e":"dead"},{"c":"فَأَحْيَيْنَا","d":"fa-aḥyaynā","e":"and We revive"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"therewith"},{"c":"الْأَرْضَ","d":"l-arḍa","e":"the earth"},{"c":"بَعْدَ","d":"baʿda","e":"after"},{"c":"مَوْتِهَا","d":"mawtihā","e":"its death"},{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"Thus"},{"c":"النُّشُورُ","d":"l-nushūru","e":"(will be) the Resurrection"}],"a":{"g":"And it is Allah who sends the winds, and they stir the clouds, and We drive them to a dead land and give life thereby to the earth after its lifelessness. Thus is the resurrection."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"Whoever"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"[is] desires"},{"c":"يُرِيدُ","d":"yurīdu","e":"[is] desires"},{"c":"الْعِزَّةَ","d":"l-ʿizata","e":"the honor"},{"c":"فَلِلَّهِ","d":"falillahi","e":"then for Allah"},{"c":"الْعِزَّةُ","d":"l-ʿizatu","e":"(is) the Honor"},{"c":"جَمِيعًا","d":"jamīʿan","e":"all"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِ","d":"ilayhi","e":"To Him"},{"c":"يَصْعَدُ","d":"yaṣʿadu","e":"ascends"},{"c":"الْكَلِمُ","d":"l-kalimu","e":"the words"},{"c":"الطَّيِّبُ","d":"l-ṭayibu","e":"good"},{"c":"وَالْعَمَلُ","d":"wal-ʿamalu","e":"and the deed"},{"c":"الصَّالِحُ","d":"l-ṣāliḥu","e":"righteous"},{"c":"يَرْفَعُهُ","d":"yarfaʿuhu","e":"raises it"},{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"But those who"},{"c":"يَمْكُرُونَ","d":"yamkurūna","e":"plot"},{"c":"السَّيِّئَاتِ","d":"l-sayiāti","e":"the evil"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"عَذَابٌ","d":"ʿadhābun","e":"(is) a punishment"},{"c":"شَدِيدٌ","d":"shadīdun","e":"severe"},{"c":"وَمَكْرُ","d":"wamakru","e":"and (the) plotting"},{"c":"أُولَئِكَ","d":"ulāika","e":"(of) those"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"it"},{"c":"يَبُورُ","d":"yabūru","e":"(will) perish"}],"a":{"g":"Whoever desires honor [through power] - then to Allah belongs all honor. To Him ascends good speech, and righteous work raises it. But they who plot evil deeds will have a severe punishment, and the plotting of those - it will perish."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"خَلَقَكُمْ","d":"khalaqakum","e":"created you"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"تُرَابٍ","d":"turābin","e":"dust"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"نُطْفَةٍ","d":"nuṭ'fatin","e":"a sperm-drop"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"جَعَلَكُمْ","d":"jaʿalakum","e":"He made you"},{"c":"أَزْوَاجًا","d":"azwājan","e":"mates"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"تَحْمِلُ","d":"taḥmilu","e":"conceives"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"أُنْثَى","d":"unthā","e":"female"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"تَضَعُ","d":"taḍaʿu","e":"gives birth"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"بِعِلْمِهِ","d":"biʿil'mihi","e":"with His knowledge"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يُعَمَّرُ","d":"yuʿammaru","e":"is granted life"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"مُعَمَّرٍ","d":"muʿammarin","e":"aged person"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"يُنْقَصُ","d":"yunqaṣu","e":"is lessened"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"عُمُرِهِ","d":"ʿumurihi","e":"his life"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"كِتَابٍ","d":"kitābin","e":"a Register"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"for"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"يَسِيرٌ","d":"yasīrun","e":"(is) easy"}],"a":{"g":"And Allah created you from dust, then from a sperm-drop; then He made you mates. And no female conceives nor does she give birth except with His knowledge. And no aged person is granted [additional] life nor is his lifespan lessened but that it is in a register. Indeed, that for Allah is easy."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يَسْتَوِي","d":"yastawī","e":"are alike"},{"c":"الْبَحْرَانِ","d":"l-baḥrāni","e":"the two seas"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"عَذْبٌ","d":"ʿadhbun","e":"(is) fresh"},{"c":"فُرَاتٌ","d":"furātun","e":"sweet"},{"c":"سَائِغٌ","d":"sāighun","e":"pleasant"},{"c":"شَرَابُهُ","d":"sharābuhu","e":"its drink"},{"c":"وَهَذَا","d":"wahādhā","e":"and this"},{"c":"مِلْحٌ","d":"mil'ḥun","e":"salty"},{"c":"أُجَاجٌ","d":"ujājun","e":"(and) bitter"},{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And from"},{"c":"كُلٍّ","d":"kullin","e":"each"},{"c":"تَأْكُلُونَ","d":"takulūna","e":"you eat"},{"c":"لَحْمًا","d":"laḥman","e":"meat"},{"c":"طَرِيًّا","d":"ṭariyyan","e":"fresh"},{"c":"وَتَسْتَخْرِجُونَ","d":"watastakhrijūna","e":"and you extract"},{"c":"حِلْيَةً","d":"ḥil'yatan","e":"ornaments"},{"c":"تَلْبَسُونَهَا","d":"talbasūnahā","e":"you wear them"},{"c":"وَتَرَى","d":"watarā","e":"and you see"},{"c":"الْفُلْكَ","d":"l-ful'ka","e":"the ships"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"in it"},{"c":"مَوَاخِرَ","d":"mawākhira","e":"cleaving"},{"c":"لِتَبْتَغُوا","d":"litabtaghū","e":"so that you may seek"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"فَضْلِهِ","d":"faḍlihi","e":"His Bounty"},{"c":"وَلَعَلَّكُمْ","d":"walaʿallakum","e":"and that you may"},{"c":"تَشْكُرُونَ","d":"tashkurūna","e":"be grateful"}],"a":{"g":"And not alike are the two bodies of water. One is fresh and sweet, palatable for drinking, and one is salty and bitter. And from each you eat tender meat and extract ornaments which you wear, and you see the ships plowing through [them] that you might seek of His bounty; and perhaps you will be grateful."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"يُولِجُ","d":"yūliju","e":"He causes to enter"},{"c":"اللَّيْلَ","d":"al-layla","e":"the night"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in (to)"},{"c":"النَّهَارِ","d":"l-nahāri","e":"the day"},{"c":"وَيُولِجُ","d":"wayūliju","e":"and He causes to enter"},{"c":"النَّهَارَ","d":"l-nahāra","e":"the day"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in (to)"},{"c":"اللَّيْلِ","d":"al-layli","e":"the night"},{"c":"وَسَخَّرَ","d":"wasakhara","e":"and He has subjected"},{"c":"الشَّمْسَ","d":"l-shamsa","e":"the sun"},{"c":"وَالْقَمَرَ","d":"wal-qamara","e":"and the moon"},{"c":"كُلٌّ","d":"kullun","e":"each"},{"c":"يَجْرِي","d":"yajrī","e":"running"},{"c":"لِأَجَلٍ","d":"li-ajalin","e":"for a term"},{"c":"مُسَمًّى","d":"musamman","e":"appointed"},{"c":"ذَلِكُمُ","d":"dhālikumu","e":"That (is)"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"رَبُّكُمْ","d":"rabbukum","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for Him"},{"c":"الْمُلْكُ","d":"l-mul'ku","e":"(is) the Dominion"},{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"And those whom"},{"c":"تَدْعُونَ","d":"tadʿūna","e":"you invoke"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"besides Him"},{"c":"دُونِهِ","d":"dūnihi","e":"besides Him"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"يَمْلِكُونَ","d":"yamlikūna","e":"they possess"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"even"},{"c":"قِطْمِيرٍ","d":"qiṭ'mīrin","e":"(as much as) the membrane of a date-seed"}],"a":{"g":"He causes the night to enter the day, and He causes the day to enter the night and has subjected the sun and the moon - each running [its course] for a specified term. That is Allah, your Lord; to Him belongs sovereignty. And those whom you invoke other than Him do not possess [as much as] the membrane of a date seed."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"If"},{"c":"تَدْعُوهُمْ","d":"tadʿūhum","e":"you invoke them"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يَسْمَعُوا","d":"yasmaʿū","e":"they hear"},{"c":"دُعَاءَكُمْ","d":"duʿāakum","e":"your call"},{"c":"وَلَوْ","d":"walaw","e":"and if"},{"c":"سَمِعُوا","d":"samiʿū","e":"they heard"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"اسْتَجَابُوا","d":"is'tajābū","e":"they (would) respond"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"to you"},{"c":"وَيَوْمَ","d":"wayawma","e":"And (on the) Day"},{"c":"الْقِيَامَةِ","d":"l-qiyāmati","e":"(of) the Resurrection"},{"c":"يَكْفُرُونَ","d":"yakfurūna","e":"they will deny"},{"c":"بِشِرْكِكُمْ","d":"bishir'kikum","e":"your association"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And none"},{"c":"يُنَبِّئُكَ","d":"yunabbi-uka","e":"can inform you"},{"c":"مِثْلُ","d":"mith'lu","e":"like"},{"c":"خَبِيرٍ","d":"khabīrin","e":"(the) All-Aware"}],"a":{"g":"If you invoke them, they do not hear your supplication; and if they heard, they would not respond to you. And on the Day of Resurrection they will deny your association. And none can inform you like [one] Acquainted [with all matters]."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"يَاأَيُّهَا","d":"yāayyuhā","e":"O"},{"c":"النَّاسُ","d":"l-nāsu","e":"mankind!"},{"c":"أَنْتُمُ","d":"antumu","e":"You"},{"c":"الْفُقَرَاءُ","d":"l-fuqarāu","e":"(are) those in need"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"of"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"while Allah"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"الْغَنِيُّ","d":"l-ghaniyu","e":"(is) Free of need"},{"c":"الْحَمِيدُ","d":"l-ḥamīdu","e":"the Praiseworthy"}],"a":{"g":"O mankind, you are those in need of Allah, while Allah is the Free of need, the Praiseworthy."}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"If"},{"c":"يَشَأْ","d":"yasha","e":"He wills"},{"c":"يُذْهِبْكُمْ","d":"yudh'hib'kum","e":"He (can) do away with you"},{"c":"وَيَأْتِ","d":"wayati","e":"and bring"},{"c":"بِخَلْقٍ","d":"bikhalqin","e":"in a creation"},{"c":"جَدِيدٍ","d":"jadīdin","e":"new"}],"a":{"g":"If He wills, He can do away with you and bring forth a new creation."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"(is) on"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"بِعَزِيزٍ","d":"biʿazīzin","e":"difficult"}],"a":{"g":"And that is for Allah not difficult."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"تَزِرُ","d":"taziru","e":"will bear"},{"c":"وَازِرَةٌ","d":"wāziratun","e":"bearer of burdens"},{"c":"وِزْرَ","d":"wiz'ra","e":"burden"},{"c":"أُخْرَى","d":"ukh'rā","e":"(of) another"},{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"And if"},{"c":"تَدْعُ","d":"tadʿu","e":"calls"},{"c":"مُثْقَلَةٌ","d":"muth'qalatun","e":"a heavily laden"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"حِمْلِهَا","d":"ḥim'lihā","e":"(carry) its load"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يُحْمَلْ","d":"yuḥ'mal","e":"will be carried"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"of it"},{"c":"شَيْءٌ","d":"shayon","e":"anything"},{"c":"وَلَوْ","d":"walaw","e":"even if"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"he be"},{"c":"ذَا","d":"dhā","e":"near of kin"},{"c":"قُرْبَى","d":"qur'bā","e":"near of kin"},{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"تُنْذِرُ","d":"tundhiru","e":"you can warn"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"يَخْشَوْنَ","d":"yakhshawna","e":"fear"},{"c":"رَبَّهُمْ","d":"rabbahum","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"بِالْغَيْبِ","d":"bil-ghaybi","e":"unseen"},{"c":"وَأَقَامُوا","d":"wa-aqāmū","e":"and establish"},{"c":"الصَّلَوةَ","d":"l-ṣalata","e":"the prayer"},{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"And whoever"},{"c":"تَزَكَّى","d":"tazakkā","e":"purifies himself"},{"c":"فَإِنَّمَا","d":"fa-innamā","e":"then only"},{"c":"يَتَزَكَّى","d":"yatazakkā","e":"he purifies"},{"c":"لِنَفْسِهِ","d":"linafsihi","e":"for his own self"},{"c":"وَإِلَى","d":"wa-ilā","e":"And to"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"الْمَصِيرُ","d":"l-maṣīru","e":"(is) the destination"}],"a":{"g":"And no bearer of burdens will bear the burden of another. And if a heavily laden soul calls [another] to [carry some of] its load, nothing of it will be carried, even if he should be a close relative. You can only warn those who fear their Lord unseen and have established prayer. And whoever purifies himself only purifies himself for [the benefit of] his soul. And to Allah is the [final] destination."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يَسْتَوِي","d":"yastawī","e":"equal"},{"c":"الْأَعْمَى","d":"l-aʿmā","e":"(are) the blind"},{"c":"وَالْبَصِيرُ","d":"wal-baṣīru","e":"and the seeing"}],"a":{"g":"Not equal are the blind and the seeing,"}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"الظُّلُمَاتُ","d":"l-ẓulumātu","e":"the darkness[es]"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"النُّورُ","d":"l-nūru","e":"[the] light"}],"a":{"g":"Nor are the darknesses and the light,"}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"الظِّلُّ","d":"l-ẓilu","e":"the shade"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"الْحَرُورُ","d":"l-ḥarūru","e":"the heat"}],"a":{"g":"Nor are the shade and the heat,"}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يَسْتَوِي","d":"yastawī","e":"equal"},{"c":"الْأَحْيَاءُ","d":"l-aḥyāu","e":"(are) the living"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"الْأَمْوَاتُ","d":"l-amwātu","e":"the dead"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"يُسْمِعُ","d":"yus'miʿu","e":"causes to hear"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"whom"},{"c":"يَشَاءُ","d":"yashāu","e":"He wills"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"أَنْتَ","d":"anta","e":"you"},{"c":"بِمُسْمِعٍ","d":"bimus'miʿin","e":"can make hear"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(those) who"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(are) in"},{"c":"الْقُبُورِ","d":"l-qubūri","e":"the graves"}],"a":{"g":"And not equal are the living and the dead. Indeed, Allah causes to hear whom He wills, but you cannot make hear those in the graves."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"أَنْتَ","d":"anta","e":"you (are)"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"نَذِيرٌ","d":"nadhīrun","e":"a warner"}],"a":{"g":"You, [O Muhammad], are not but a warner."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"أَرْسَلْنَاكَ","d":"arsalnāka","e":"[We] have sent you"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"with the truth"},{"c":"بَشِيرًا","d":"bashīran","e":"(as) a bearer of glad tidings"},{"c":"وَنَذِيرًا","d":"wanadhīran","e":"and (as) a warner"},{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"And not"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(was) any"},{"c":"أُمَّةٍ","d":"ummatin","e":"nation"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"خَلَا","d":"khalā","e":"had passed"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"within it"},{"c":"نَذِيرٌ","d":"nadhīrun","e":"a warner"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We have sent you with the truth as a bringer of good tidings and a warner. And there was no nation but that there had passed within it a warner."}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"And if"},{"c":"يُكَذِّبُوكَ","d":"yukadhibūka","e":"they deny you"},{"c":"فَقَدْ","d":"faqad","e":"then certainly"},{"c":"كَذَّبَ","d":"kadhaba","e":"denied"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(were) before them"},{"c":"قَبْلِهِمْ","d":"qablihim","e":"(were) before them"},{"c":"جَاءَتْهُمْ","d":"jāathum","e":"Came to them"},{"c":"رُسُلُهُمْ","d":"rusuluhum","e":"their Messengers"},{"c":"بِالْبَيِّنَاتِ","d":"bil-bayināti","e":"with clear signs"},{"c":"وَبِالزُّبُرِ","d":"wabil-zuburi","e":"and with Scriptures"},{"c":"وَبِالْكِتَابِ","d":"wabil-kitābi","e":"and with the Book"},{"c":"الْمُنِيرِ","d":"l-munīri","e":"[the] enlightening"}],"a":{"g":"And if they deny you - then already have those before them denied. Their messengers came to them with clear proofs and written ordinances and with the enlightening Scripture."}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"أَخَذْتُ","d":"akhadhtu","e":"I seized"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieved"},{"c":"فَكَيْفَ","d":"fakayfa","e":"and how"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"was"},{"c":"نَكِيرِ","d":"nakīri","e":"My rejection!"}],"a":{"g":"Then I seized the ones who disbelieved, and how [terrible] was My reproach."}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Do not"},{"c":"تَرَ","d":"tara","e":"you see"},{"c":"أَنَّ","d":"anna","e":"that"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"أَنْزَلَ","d":"anzala","e":"sends down"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the sky"},{"c":"مَاءً","d":"māan","e":"water"},{"c":"فَأَخْرَجْنَا","d":"fa-akhrajnā","e":"then We bring forth"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"therewith"},{"c":"ثَمَرَاتٍ","d":"thamarātin","e":"fruits"},{"c":"مُخْتَلِفًا","d":"mukh'talifan","e":"(of) various"},{"c":"أَلْوَانُهَا","d":"alwānuhā","e":"[their] colors"},{"c":"وَمِنَ","d":"wamina","e":"And in"},{"c":"الْجِبَالِ","d":"l-jibāli","e":"the mountains"},{"c":"جُدَدٌ","d":"judadun","e":"(are) tracts"},{"c":"بِيضٌ","d":"bīḍun","e":"white"},{"c":"وَحُمْرٌ","d":"waḥum'run","e":"and red"},{"c":"مُخْتَلِفٌ","d":"mukh'talifun","e":"(of) various"},{"c":"أَلْوَانُهَا","d":"alwānuhā","e":"[their] colors"},{"c":"وَغَرَابِيبُ","d":"wagharābību","e":"and intensely black"},{"c":"سُودٌ","d":"sūdun","e":"and intensely black"}],"a":{"g":"Do you not see that Allah sends down rain from the sky, and We produce thereby fruits of varying colors? And in the mountains are tracts, white and red of varying shades and [some] extremely black."}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنَ","d":"wamina","e":"And among"},{"c":"النَّاسِ","d":"l-nāsi","e":"men"},{"c":"وَالدَّوَابِّ","d":"wal-dawābi","e":"and moving creatures"},{"c":"وَالْأَنْعَامِ","d":"wal-anʿāmi","e":"and the cattle"},{"c":"مُخْتَلِفٌ","d":"mukh'talifun","e":"(are) various"},{"c":"أَلْوَانُهُ","d":"alwānuhu","e":"[their] colors"},{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"likewise"},{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"يَخْشَى","d":"yakhshā","e":"fear"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"among"},{"c":"عِبَادِهِ","d":"ʿibādihi","e":"His slaves"},{"c":"الْعُلَمَؤُا","d":"l-ʿulamāu","e":"those who have knowledge"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"عَزِيزٌ","d":"ʿazīzun","e":"(is) All-Mighty"},{"c":"غَفُورٌ","d":"ghafūrun","e":"Oft-Forgiving"}],"a":{"g":"And among people and moving creatures and grazing livestock are various colors similarly. Only those fear Allah, from among His servants, who have knowledge. Indeed, Allah is Exalted in Might and Forgiving."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"يَتْلُونَ","d":"yatlūna","e":"recite"},{"c":"كِتَابَ","d":"kitāba","e":"(the) Book"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"وَأَقَامُوا","d":"wa-aqāmū","e":"and establish"},{"c":"الصَّلَوةَ","d":"l-ṣalata","e":"the prayer"},{"c":"وَأَنْفَقُوا","d":"wa-anfaqū","e":"and spend"},{"c":"مِمَّا","d":"mimmā","e":"out of what"},{"c":"رَزَقْنَاهُمْ","d":"razaqnāhum","e":"We have provided them"},{"c":"سِرًّا","d":"sirran","e":"secretly"},{"c":"وَعَلَانِيَةً","d":"waʿalāniyatan","e":"and openly"},{"c":"يَرْجُونَ","d":"yarjūna","e":"hope"},{"c":"تِجَارَةً","d":"tijāratan","e":"(for) a commerce"},{"c":"لَنْ","d":"lan","e":"never"},{"c":"تَبُورَ","d":"tabūra","e":"it will perish"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, those who recite the Book of Allah and establish prayer and spend [in His cause] out of what We have provided them, secretly and publicly, [can] expect a profit that will never perish -"}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"لِيُوَفِّيَهُمْ","d":"liyuwaffiyahum","e":"That He may give them in full"},{"c":"أُجُورَهُمْ","d":"ujūrahum","e":"their rewards"},{"c":"وَيَزِيدَهُمْ","d":"wayazīdahum","e":"and increase for them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"فَضْلِهِ","d":"faḍlihi","e":"His Bounty"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed He"},{"c":"غَفُورٌ","d":"ghafūrun","e":"(is) Oft-Forgiving"},{"c":"شَكُورٌ","d":"shakūrun","e":"Most Appreciative"}],"a":{"g":"That He may give them in full their rewards and increase for them of His bounty. Indeed, He is Forgiving and Appreciative."}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"وَالَّذِي","d":"wa-alladhī","e":"And (that) which"},{"c":"أَوْحَيْنَا","d":"awḥaynā","e":"We have revealed"},{"c":"إِلَيْكَ","d":"ilayka","e":"to you"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْكِتَابِ","d":"l-kitābi","e":"the Book"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"it"},{"c":"الْحَقُّ","d":"l-ḥaqu","e":"(is) the truth"},{"c":"مُصَدِّقًا","d":"muṣaddiqan","e":"confirming"},{"c":"لِمَا","d":"limā","e":"what (was)"},{"c":"بَيْنَ","d":"bayna","e":"before it"},{"c":"يَدَيْهِ","d":"yadayhi","e":"before it"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"بِعِبَادِهِ","d":"biʿibādihi","e":"of His slaves"},{"c":"لَخَبِيرٌ","d":"lakhabīrun","e":"surely, (is) All-Aware"},{"c":"بَصِيرٌ","d":"baṣīrun","e":"All-Seer"}],"a":{"g":"And that which We have revealed to you, [O Muhammad], of the Book is the truth, confirming what was before it. Indeed, Allah, of His servants, is Acquainted and Seeing."}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"أَوْرَثْنَا","d":"awrathnā","e":"We caused to inherit"},{"c":"الْكِتَابَ","d":"l-kitāba","e":"the Book"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those whom"},{"c":"اصْطَفَيْنَا","d":"iṣ'ṭafaynā","e":"We have chosen"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"عِبَادِنَا","d":"ʿibādinā","e":"Our slaves"},{"c":"فَمِنْهُمْ","d":"famin'hum","e":"and among them"},{"c":"ظَالِمٌ","d":"ẓālimun","e":"(is he) who wrongs"},{"c":"لِنَفْسِهِ","d":"linafsihi","e":"himself"},{"c":"وَمِنْهُمْ","d":"wamin'hum","e":"and among them"},{"c":"مُقْتَصِدٌ","d":"muq'taṣidun","e":"(is he who is) moderate"},{"c":"وَمِنْهُمْ","d":"wamin'hum","e":"and among them"},{"c":"سَابِقٌ","d":"sābiqun","e":"(is he who is) foremost"},{"c":"بِالْخَيْرَاتِ","d":"bil-khayrāti","e":"in good deeds"},{"c":"بِإِذْنِ","d":"bi-idh'ni","e":"by permission"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"is"},{"c":"الْفَضْلُ","d":"l-faḍlu","e":"the Bounty"},{"c":"الْكَبِيرُ","d":"l-kabīru","e":"the great"}],"a":{"g":"Then we caused to inherit the Book those We have chosen of Our servants; and among them is he who wrongs himself, and among them is he who is moderate, and among them is he who is foremost in good deeds by permission of Allah. That [inheritance] is what is the great bounty."}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"جَنَّاتُ","d":"jannātu","e":"Gardens"},{"c":"عَدْنٍ","d":"ʿadnin","e":"(of) Eternity"},{"c":"يَدْخُلُونَهَا","d":"yadkhulūnahā","e":"they will enter them"},{"c":"يُحَلَّوْنَ","d":"yuḥallawna","e":"They will be adorned"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"with"},{"c":"أَسَاوِرَ","d":"asāwira","e":"bracelets"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"ذَهَبٍ","d":"dhahabin","e":"gold"},{"c":"وَلُؤْلُؤًا","d":"walu'lu-an","e":"and pearls"},{"c":"وَلِبَاسُهُمْ","d":"walibāsuhum","e":"and their garments"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"حَرِيرٌ","d":"ḥarīrun","e":"(will be of) silk"}],"a":{"g":"[For them are] gardens of perpetual residence which they will enter. They will be adorned therein with bracelets of gold and pearls, and their garments therein will be silk."}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالُوا","d":"waqālū","e":"And they (will) say"},{"c":"الْحَمْدُ","d":"l-ḥamdu","e":"All praises"},{"c":"لِلَّهِ","d":"lillahi","e":"(be) to Allah"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"the One Who"},{"c":"أَذْهَبَ","d":"adhhaba","e":"(has) removed"},{"c":"عَنَّا","d":"ʿannā","e":"from us"},{"c":"الْحَزَنَ","d":"l-ḥazana","e":"the sorrow"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"رَبَّنَا","d":"rabbanā","e":"our Lord"},{"c":"لَغَفُورٌ","d":"laghafūrun","e":"(is) surely Oft-Forgiving"},{"c":"شَكُورٌ","d":"shakūrun","e":"Most Appreciative"}],"a":{"g":"And they will say, \"Praise to Allah, who has removed from us [all] sorrow. Indeed, our Lord is Forgiving and Appreciative -"}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"The One Who"},{"c":"أَحَلَّنَا","d":"aḥallanā","e":"has settled us"},{"c":"دَارَ","d":"dāra","e":"(in) a Home"},{"c":"الْمُقَامَةِ","d":"l-muqāmati","e":"(of) Eternity"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(out) of"},{"c":"فَضْلِهِ","d":"faḍlihi","e":"His Bounty"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يَمَسُّنَا","d":"yamassunā","e":"touches us"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"نَصَبٌ","d":"naṣabun","e":"any fatigue"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"يَمَسُّنَا","d":"yamassunā","e":"touches"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"لُغُوبٌ","d":"lughūbun","e":"weariness"}],"a":{"g":"He who has settled us in the home of duration out of His bounty. There touches us not in it any fatigue, and there touches us not in it weariness [of mind].\""}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"And those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"نَارُ","d":"nāru","e":"(will be the) Fire"},{"c":"جَهَنَّمَ","d":"jahannama","e":"(of) Hell"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يُقْضَى","d":"yuq'ḍā","e":"is decreed"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"for them"},{"c":"فَيَمُوتُوا","d":"fayamūtū","e":"that they die"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"يُخَفَّفُ","d":"yukhaffafu","e":"will be lightened"},{"c":"عَنْهُمْ","d":"ʿanhum","e":"for them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"عَذَابِهَا","d":"ʿadhābihā","e":"its torment"},{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"Thus"},{"c":"نَجْزِي","d":"najzī","e":"We recompense"},{"c":"كُلَّ","d":"kulla","e":"every"},{"c":"كَفُورٍ","d":"kafūrin","e":"ungrateful one"}],"a":{"g":"And for those who disbelieve will be the fire of Hell. [Death] is not decreed for them so they may die, nor will its torment be lightened for them. Thus do we recompense every ungrateful one."}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"وَهُمْ","d":"wahum","e":"And they"},{"c":"يَصْطَرِخُونَ","d":"yaṣṭarikhūna","e":"will cry"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"رَبَّنَا","d":"rabbanā","e":"Our Lord!"},{"c":"أَخْرِجْنَا","d":"akhrij'nā","e":"Bring us out"},{"c":"نَعْمَلْ","d":"naʿmal","e":"we will do"},{"c":"صَالِحًا","d":"ṣāliḥan","e":"righteous (deeds)"},{"c":"غَيْرَ","d":"ghayra","e":"other than"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(that) which"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"we used"},{"c":"نَعْمَلُ","d":"naʿmalu","e":"(to) do"},{"c":"أَوَلَمْ","d":"awalam","e":"Did not"},{"c":"نُعَمِّرْكُمْ","d":"nuʿammir'kum","e":"We give you life long enough"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"that"},{"c":"يَتَذَكَّرُ","d":"yatadhakkaru","e":"(would) receive admonition"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"therein"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"whoever"},{"c":"تَذَكَّرَ","d":"tadhakkara","e":"receives admonition"},{"c":"وَجَاءَكُمُ","d":"wajāakumu","e":"And came to you"},{"c":"النَّذِيرُ","d":"l-nadhīru","e":"the warner"},{"c":"فَذُوقُوا","d":"fadhūqū","e":"So taste"},{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"then not"},{"c":"لِلظَّالِمِينَ","d":"lilẓẓālimīna","e":"(is) for the wrongdoers"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"نَصِيرٍ","d":"naṣīrin","e":"helper"}],"a":{"g":"And they will cry out therein, \"Our Lord, remove us; we will do righteousness - other than what we were doing!\" But did We not grant you life enough for whoever would remember therein to remember, and the warner had come to you? So taste [the punishment], for there is not for the wrongdoers any helper."}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"عَالِمُ","d":"ʿālimu","e":"(is the) Knower"},{"c":"غَيْبِ","d":"ghaybi","e":"(of the) unseen"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"(of) the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed, He"},{"c":"عَلِيمٌ","d":"ʿalīmun","e":"(is the) All-Knower"},{"c":"بِذَاتِ","d":"bidhāti","e":"of what (is) in the breasts"},{"c":"الصُّدُورِ","d":"l-ṣudūri","e":"of what (is) in the breasts"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, Allah is Knower of the unseen [aspects] of the heavens and earth. Indeed, He is Knowing of that within the breasts."}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) the One Who"},{"c":"جَعَلَكُمْ","d":"jaʿalakum","e":"made you"},{"c":"خَلَائِفَ","d":"khalāifa","e":"successors"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"فَمَنْ","d":"faman","e":"And whoever"},{"c":"كَفَرَ","d":"kafara","e":"disbelieves"},{"c":"فَعَلَيْهِ","d":"faʿalayhi","e":"then upon him"},{"c":"كُفْرُهُ","d":"kuf'ruhu","e":"(is) his disbelief"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يَزِيدُ","d":"yazīdu","e":"increase"},{"c":"الْكَافِرِينَ","d":"l-kāfirīna","e":"the disbelievers"},{"c":"كُفْرُهُمْ","d":"kuf'ruhum","e":"their disbelief"},{"c":"عِنْدَ","d":"ʿinda","e":"near"},{"c":"رَبِّهِمْ","d":"rabbihim","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"مَقْتًا","d":"maqtan","e":"(in) hatred"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"يَزِيدُ","d":"yazīdu","e":"increase"},{"c":"الْكَافِرِينَ","d":"l-kāfirīna","e":"the disbelievers"},{"c":"كُفْرُهُمْ","d":"kuf'ruhum","e":"their disbelief"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"خَسَارًا","d":"khasāran","e":"(in) loss"}],"a":{"g":"It is He who has made you successors upon the earth. And whoever disbelieves - upon him will be [the consequence of] his disbelief. And the disbelief of the disbelievers does not increase them in the sight of their Lord except in hatred; and the disbelief of the disbelievers does not increase them except in loss."}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","d":"ara-aytum","e":"Have you seen"},{"c":"شُرَكَاءَكُمُ","d":"shurakāakumu","e":"your partners"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those whom"},{"c":"تَدْعُونَ","d":"tadʿūna","e":"you call"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"besides"},{"c":"دُونِ","d":"dūni","e":"besides"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"أَرُونِي","d":"arūnī","e":"Show Me"},{"c":"مَاذَا","d":"mādhā","e":"what"},{"c":"خَلَقُوا","d":"khalaqū","e":"they have created"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"شِرْكٌ","d":"shir'kun","e":"(is) a share"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"ءَاتَيْنَاهُمْ","d":"ātaynāhum","e":"have We given them"},{"c":"كِتَابًا","d":"kitāban","e":"a Book"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"so they"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"(are) on"},{"c":"بَيِّنَتٍ","d":"bayyinatin","e":"a clear proof"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"therefrom"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"not"},{"c":"يَعِدُ","d":"yaʿidu","e":"promise"},{"c":"الظَّالِمُونَ","d":"l-ẓālimūna","e":"the wrongdoers"},{"c":"بَعْضُهُمْ","d":"baʿḍuhum","e":"some of them"},{"c":"بَعْضًا","d":"baʿḍan","e":"(to) others"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"غُرُورًا","d":"ghurūran","e":"delusion"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"Have you considered your 'partners' whom you invoke besides Allah? Show me what they have created from the earth, or have they partnership [with Him] in the heavens? Or have We given them a book so they are [standing] on evidence therefrom? [No], rather, the wrongdoers do not promise each other except delusion.\""}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"يُمْسِكُ","d":"yum'siku","e":"upholds"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضَ","d":"wal-arḍa","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"lest"},{"c":"تَزُولَا","d":"tazūlā","e":"they cease"},{"c":"وَلَئِنْ","d":"wala-in","e":"And if"},{"c":"زَالَتَا","d":"zālatā","e":"they should cease"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"not"},{"c":"أَمْسَكَهُمَا","d":"amsakahumā","e":"can uphold them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"أَحَدٍ","d":"aḥadin","e":"one"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"after Him"},{"c":"بَعْدِهِ","d":"baʿdihi","e":"after Him"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed, He"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"حَلِيمًا","d":"ḥalīman","e":"Most Forbearing"},{"c":"غَفُورًا","d":"ghafūran","e":"Oft-Forgiving"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, Allah holds the heavens and the earth, lest they cease. And if they should cease, no one could hold them [in place] after Him. Indeed, He is Forbearing and Forgiving."}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَقْسَمُوا","d":"wa-aqsamū","e":"And they swore"},{"c":"بِاللَّهِ","d":"bil-lahi","e":"by Allah"},{"c":"جَهْدَ","d":"jahda","e":"(the) strongest"},{"c":"أَيْمَانِهِمْ","d":"aymānihim","e":"(of) their oaths"},{"c":"لَئِنْ","d":"la-in","e":"that if"},{"c":"جَاءَهُمْ","d":"jāahum","e":"came to them"},{"c":"نَذِيرٌ","d":"nadhīrun","e":"a warner"},{"c":"لَيَكُونُنَّ","d":"layakūnunna","e":"surely they would be"},{"c":"أَهْدَى","d":"ahdā","e":"more guided"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"than"},{"c":"إِحْدَى","d":"iḥ'dā","e":"any"},{"c":"الْأُمَمِ","d":"l-umami","e":"(of) the nations"},{"c":"فَلَمَّا","d":"falammā","e":"But when"},{"c":"جَاءَهُمْ","d":"jāahum","e":"came to them"},{"c":"نَذِيرٌ","d":"nadhīrun","e":"a warner"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"زَادَهُمْ","d":"zādahum","e":"it increased them"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"نُفُورًا","d":"nufūran","e":"(in) aversion"}],"a":{"g":"And they swore by Allah their strongest oaths that if a warner came to them, they would be more guided than [any] one of the [previous] nations. But when a warner came to them, it did not increase them except in aversion."}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"اسْتِكْبَارًا","d":"is'tik'bāran","e":"(Due to) arrogance"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the land"},{"c":"وَمَكْرَ","d":"wamakra","e":"and plotting"},{"c":"السَّيِّئِ","d":"l-sayi-i","e":"(of) the evil"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"but not"},{"c":"يَحِيقُ","d":"yaḥīqu","e":"encompasses"},{"c":"الْمَكْرُ","d":"l-makru","e":"the plot"},{"c":"السَّيِّئُ","d":"l-sayi-u","e":"(of) the evil"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"بِأَهْلِهِ","d":"bi-ahlihi","e":"its own people"},{"c":"فَهَلْ","d":"fahal","e":"Then do"},{"c":"يَنْظُرُونَ","d":"yanẓurūna","e":"they wait"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"سُنَّتَ","d":"sunnata","e":"(the) way"},{"c":"الْأَوَّلِينَ","d":"l-awalīna","e":"(of) the former (people)"},{"c":"فَلَنْ","d":"falan","e":"But never"},{"c":"تَجِدَ","d":"tajida","e":"you will find"},{"c":"لِسُنَّتِ","d":"lisunnati","e":"in (the) way"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"تَبْدِيلًا","d":"tabdīlan","e":"any change"},{"c":"وَلَنْ","d":"walan","e":"and never"},{"c":"تَجِدَ","d":"tajida","e":"you will find"},{"c":"لِسُنَّتِ","d":"lisunnati","e":"in (the) way"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"تَحْوِيلًا","d":"taḥwīlan","e":"any alteration"}],"a":{"g":"[Due to] arrogance in the land and plotting of evil; but the evil plot does not encompass except its own people. Then do they await except the way of the former peoples? But you will never find in the way of Allah any change, and you will never find in the way of Allah any alteration."}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"أَوَلَمْ","d":"awalam","e":"Have they not"},{"c":"يَسِيرُوا","d":"yasīrū","e":"traveled"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the land"},{"c":"فَيَنْظُرُوا","d":"fayanẓurū","e":"and seen"},{"c":"كَيْفَ","d":"kayfa","e":"how"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"was"},{"c":"عَاقِبَةُ","d":"ʿāqibatu","e":"(the) end"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"(of) those who"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(were) before them"},{"c":"قَبْلِهِمْ","d":"qablihim","e":"(were) before them"},{"c":"وَكَانُوا","d":"wakānū","e":"And they were"},{"c":"أَشَدَّ","d":"ashadda","e":"stronger"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"than them"},{"c":"قُوَّةً","d":"quwwatan","e":"(in) power"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"But not"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"لِيُعْجِزَهُ","d":"liyuʿ'jizahu","e":"that can escape (from) Him"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed, He"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"عَلِيمًا","d":"ʿalīman","e":"All-Knower"},{"c":"قَدِيرًا","d":"qadīran","e":"All-Powerful"}],"a":{"g":"Have they not traveled through the land and observed how was the end of those before them? And they were greater than them in power. But Allah is not to be caused failure by anything in the heavens or on the earth. Indeed, He is ever Knowing and Competent."}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَوْ","d":"walaw","e":"And if"},{"c":"يُؤَاخِذُ","d":"yuākhidhu","e":"Allah (were to) punish"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah (were to) punish"},{"c":"النَّاسَ","d":"l-nāsa","e":"the people"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"for what"},{"c":"كَسَبُوا","d":"kasabū","e":"they have earned"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"تَرَكَ","d":"taraka","e":"He would leave"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"ظَهْرِهَا","d":"ẓahrihā","e":"its back"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"دَابَّةٍ","d":"dābbatin","e":"creature"},{"c":"وَلَكِنْ","d":"walākin","e":"But"},{"c":"يُؤَخِّرُهُمْ","d":"yu-akhiruhum","e":"He gives them respite"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"till"},{"c":"أَجَلٍ","d":"ajalin","e":"a term"},{"c":"مُسَمًّى","d":"musamman","e":"appointed"},{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"جَاءَ","d":"jāa","e":"comes"},{"c":"أَجَلُهُمْ","d":"ajaluhum","e":"their term"},{"c":"فَإِنَّ","d":"fa-inna","e":"then indeed"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"بِعِبَادِهِ","d":"biʿibādihi","e":"of His slaves"},{"c":"بَصِيرًا","d":"baṣīran","e":"All-Seer"}],"a":{"g":"And if Allah were to impose blame on the people for what they have earned, He would not leave upon the earth any creature. But He defers them for a specified term. And when their time comes, then indeed Allah has ever been, of His servants, Seeing."}}}